<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italy CTZ bill auctions.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italy CTZ bill auctions.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of 18-month December 30, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of July 15, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Dec 30, 98  Pvs    July 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.32 pct    5.21   5.27 pct    5.16</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.06	  5.95   5.99	  5.88</p>
<p>Assigned price 92.00	 91.90  89.25	 89.20</p>
<p>Bids	     3.72 trillion lire   4.25 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.00 trillion lire   2.00 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The results are compared with those at the previous July 10 auctions.</p>
</text>
